$ varag audit judge --help
# started 2026-10-22T03:16:51.289+00:00
Usage: varag audit judge [OPTIONS]

  LLM judge for version mixing: calibrate on the 50 labelled audit outputs (go
  on only at 45 of 50 or more), then judge every flagged answer and a
  stratified 600 of the clean ones; writes docs/results/final-<stamp>/judge/
  and rewrites the summary.

Options:
  --record FILE    The final sweep record (default: the newest runs/sweep-
                   final-*.json).
  --max-usd FLOAT  Spending cap for the judge calls.  [default: 5.0]
  --help           Show this message and exit.
